    "title": "How to Watch Nuggets vs. 76ers for Free: NBA Streaming, Tipoff Time, Betting Odds",
    "text": "Nikola Jokic and the Denver Nuggets will host Tyrese Maxey and the Philadelphia 76ers in Denver on Tuesday night.Jokic and his Nuggets squad are a respectable 41-27, good enough for second in the Northwest division behind Shai Gilgeous-Alexander and the Oklahoma City Thunder. The Nuggets most recently lost on Saturday 127-125 to the Los Angeles Lakers from a game-winner by Luka Doncic in overtime. The MVP center leads Denver in points per game at 28.6, rebounds at 12.7 per game, and assists at 10.5 per game.AdvertisementThe 76ers are 37-31 and are riding a four-game winning streak into Denver. Sitting at fourth in the Atlantic division and No. 9 in the Eastern Conference, the 76ers are led by their point guard Tyrese Maxey, who averages team highs in points per game at 29.0 and assists per game at 6.7. Unfortunately for Philadelphia, the team will be without its leading scorer for Tuesday's matchup.Philadelphia 76ers guard Tyrese Maxey (0)Dale Zanine-Imagn Images (Dale Zanine-Imagn Images)Nuggets vs. 76ers Tipoff TimeNuggets vs. 76ers will tip off on Tuesday at 10:00 p.m. ET. The game will be played at the Ball Arena in Denver, Colorado.AdvertisementWhat TV Channel is Nuggets vs. 76ers on?The matchup between the Nuggets vs. 76ers will air on Altitude Sports, NBC Sports Philadelphia, and NBC.How to Live Stream Nuggets vs. 76ers for FreeFans can stream Nuggets vs. 76ers for free via Fubo when they sign up for a 7-day free trial.Nuggets vs. 76ers Betting OddsSpread: Hornets -15.5 (via ESPN Bet)Over/Under: 236.5Money line: 76ers +750, Nuggets -1200Related: Lakers React to Luka Doncic Announcement on MondayThis story was originally published by Athlon Sports on Mar 18, 2026, where it first appeared in the NBA section. Add Athlon Sports as a Preferred Source by clicking here.",
